.policy "ruff-pyi013-ellipsis-in-non-empty-class-body" revision 2
.description "Remove an ellipsis statement from a class body that has other statements; it is only needed when the body would otherwise be empty."
.language python
.mode steer
.scope include "**/*"

// Ruff PYI013 (flake8-pyi), every file: a `...` statement in a class body that has other statements, a
// docstring included.
//   class C:
//       """Doc."""
//       ...                ← PYI013
#include "python/typing.rr"

.violation PYI013(at: node) code "PYI013" "Remove this `...` from the class body; it is redundant because the body has other statements."
    suppress ruff "PYI013"
PYI013(s) :- class_body(_, b), body_len(b, k), k > 1, body_stmt(b, s, _), ellipsis_stmt(s).
